WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Muslims believe that in a
mountain cave called Hira,

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.460
the first words of the
Qur'an were revealed.

3
00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:11.960
In the Bible, a psalm sings: the
heavens declare the glory of God.

4
00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:15.780
One is a message given at
one moment, in one place.

5
00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.030
The other is a sky that
anyone can look up at.

6
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.860
If God exists, how could anyone
ever know what God is like?

7
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:29.200
In this mission, you'll sort the ways
believers say God is revealed into two kinds.

8
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.260
Then you'll weigh up the problems, from
conflicting claims to honest mistakes.

9
00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:38.350
Your mission: find out how anyone
could know what God is like.
